      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    equity_market_value = 150\n    debt_market_value = 100\n    cost_of_equity = 0.09\n    cost_of_debt = 0.05\n    tax_rate = 0.25\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_value = equity_market_value + debt_market_value\n    equity_weight = equity_market_value / total_value\n    debt_weight = debt_market_value / total_value\n    wacc = equity_weight * cost_of_equity + debt_weight * cost_of_debt * (1 - tax_rate)\n    answer = round(wacc * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
